cked, no contradicting code found, still unconfirmed against the source\" would have been useful. That could be a `note` or `status` parameter on `verify`, or a separate lightweight call.\n\nI also never called `get` or `query`. I loaded the schemas for `get` and `verify` and then answered from the grep output, which already contained the memory text. That was my choice, not a tooling limit.", "debrief_cost_usd": 0.0931264, "retries": 0}, "rep": 0}
